Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:07.40,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,FEI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:06.78,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,We finally made it...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:07.40,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:12.57,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,QIN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.76,0:00:12.57,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,The ones who got here first--\Nthey're not setting up camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:16.65,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Although the allied Qin \Narmy had arrived at Jin'an,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.65,0:00:19.34,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,where they were to change their route...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:21.12,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,WANG
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:26.18,MX Default,Qin General A,0,0,0,,The last one has arrived: \NXin, of the Fei Xin Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:29.22,MX Default,Qin General B,0,0,0,,You're late, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.22,0:00:32.02,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Sorry. Got turned around \Nlookin' for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.02,0:00:33.01,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:34.58,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,That {\i1}hurt{\i0}, General Tu Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.58,0:00:37.47,MX Default,Tu Men,0,0,0,,For a straggler, you've got a real attitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:40.43,MX Default,Qin General C,0,0,0,,Our generals are all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:43.89,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,We're moving out soon, \Nso I'll keep this brief:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.55,0:00:49.21,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,The entire army is changing course out \Nof Jin'an, heading instead for Yè.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.28,0:02:23.45,On Top,Title,0,0,0,,ZHAO'S NATIONAL GATE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:23.74,MX Default,Walla?,0,0,0,,"Moving out soon"? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.74,0:02:25.62,MX Default,Qin General D,0,0,0,,We're changing course?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.62,0:02:27.01,MX Default,Bi,0,0,0,,Yè?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.34,0:02:30.50,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.89,0:02:36.13,MX Default,Bi,0,0,0,,A-A moment, sir! Aren't \Nwe heading for Heiyong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:40.84,MX Default,Bi,0,0,0,,And by "Yè," do you mean Zhao's \Nsecond-largest city Yè?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.12,0:02:42.09,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.55,0:02:45.22,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Preparations have been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.84,0:02:47.89,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:50.15,MX Default,Qin General E,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.15,0:02:53.17,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Each general is to act on \Nhis or her own authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:55.11,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,If a single unit falters,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:58.11,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,its captain will be summarily beheaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.49,0:03:00.61,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:02.50,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,Ooh, scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:03.82,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.11,0:03:05.12,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:06.04,MX Default,Qin Generals,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.55,0:03:12.67,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Damn. My troops are totally gonna grumble \Nand drag their feet when they hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.15,0:03:16.34,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Still, I guess this is it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:18.09,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.29,0:03:23.18,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Li Mu's bound to notice \Nour change of direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.78,0:03:25.96,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,There's no going back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.94,0:03:30.52,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,As if we {\i1}ever{\i0} had that option!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:35.53,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,Don't get carried away. We haven't \Nbroken into the capital region yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:41.23,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, Wang Ben. It's why we're \Nspending all night getting ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.92,0:03:46.53,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Dammit--I wanted to see the look \Non Li Mu's flabbergasted face!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.53,0:03:48.79,On Top - More Top,Caption,0,0,0,,WUBAI, ZHAO'S WESTERN FRONT
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:48.79,MX Default,Zhao Messenger A,0,0,0,,Urgent report!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.31,0:03:50.99,MX Default,Zhao Messenger A,0,0,0,,Ganwei has fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.99,0:03:52.16,MX Default,Jin Mao,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:53.87,MX Default,Zhao Messenger B,0,0,0,,Lingxuan has fallen as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.87,0:03:57.84,MX Default,Jin Mao,0,0,0,,Damn that Yan army. Lingxuan \Nwas a strategic base!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:57.82,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,YAN
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.39,0:03:59.80,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Wu Lu Duo...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.23,0:04:03.66,MX Default,Jin Mao,0,0,0,,Li Mu, sir, General Hu Zhe has left Handan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.74,0:04:05.58,MX Default,Jin Mao,0,0,0,,I suggest we send him east.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:11.68,MX Default,Jin Mao,0,0,0,,If we don't put a stop to Yan's invasion,\Nour eastern defenses may be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:17.96,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Sending Hu Zhe east would mean big \Nchanges to our western strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:20.86,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,But I suppose I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.52,0:04:24.24,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Kaine, send urgent word to General Hu Zhe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.24,0:04:25.36,MX Default,Kaine,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:27.57,MX Default,Mǎ Nanci,0,0,0,,What about Yan's route?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.01,0:04:32.08,MX Default,Messenger A,0,0,0,,Sir! It appears they're going \Nafter the central city of Qingge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.50,0:04:34.81,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Qingge?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.61,0:04:37.01,MX Default,Kaine,0,0,0,,Li Mu, sir...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:39.46,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Qingge...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.85,0:04:41.46,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,But that's where...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:44.22,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,SIMA
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:44.22,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Sima Shang is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:45.95,MX Default,Kaine,0,0,0,,Sima Shang?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.95,0:04:47.05,MX Default,Fu Di,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.41,0:04:49.67,MX Default,Jin Mao,0,0,0,,I've heard the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.67,0:04:54.14,MX Default,Jin Mao,0,0,0,,Qingge's lord--bedridden for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:59.44,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,But not ill. He hates the central \Ngovernment, so he ignores all their orders
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:02.61,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,under the pretense of being ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:08.37,MX Default,Mǎ Nanci,0,0,0,,He used that same excuse to \Nrefuse to join the Three Greats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.86,0:05:12.89,MX Default,Kaine,0,0,0,,Th-The Three Greats?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.89,0:05:14.33,MX Default,Fu Di,0,0,0,,He {\i1}refused{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.33,0:05:19.34,MX Default,Zhao General A,0,0,0,,Insane... There was a candidate\N worthy of being the third Great?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.34,0:05:22.88,MX Default,Fu Di,0,0,0,,I can't believe it... I just can't \Nbelieve it... It's unbelievable...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:25.17,MX Default,Zhao Messenger A,0,0,0,,And he's out on the frontier?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:30.77,MX Default,Mǎ Cheng,0,0,0,,You utter fools. The frontier is \Nexactly where mad geniuses live.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.77,0:05:31.64,MX Default,Ji Hui,0,0,0,,Mǎ Cheng...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:35.35,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,I'm the one who nominated \Nhim for the Three Greats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:41.27,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,As long as Qingge remains uninvaded, \NSima Shang won't act on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.58,0:05:47.30,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,My nomination {\i1}was{\i0} in part an attempt \Nto light a fire under the man,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:49.17,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,but his capability is without a doubt--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.17,0:05:50.27,MX Default,Zhao Messenger C,0,0,0,,Urgent report!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:53.56,MX Default,Zhao Messenger C,0,0,0,,Movement at Qingge, to the east!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:58.75,MX Default,Zhao Messenger C,0,0,0,,Five thousand Qingge troops are on \Nthe move, led by Sima Shang himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.47,0:06:01.59,MX Default,Fu Di,0,0,0,,Sima Shang has entered the fray!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.91,0:06:02.75,MX Default,Mǎ Nanci,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:05.88,MX Default,Mǎ Nanci,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call \Ntreading on the tiger's tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:10.43,MX Default,Mǎ Nanci,0,0,0,,Your intel-gathering in the \Neast is lacking, Wu Lu Duo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.86,0:06:14.67,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Kaine, cancel that urgent \Nmessage to General Hu Zhe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:15.52,MX Default,Kaine,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:17.94,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Let's all take a moment to collect ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.56,0:06:22.24,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Our eastern defensive line \Nis still in place and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:23.19,MX Default,Kaine,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:29.95,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Incidentally, why hasn't Shun Shuishu \Nreturned from the front lines?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.52,0:06:34.85,MX Default,Zhao General A,0,0,0,,My apologies, sir. The urgent message \Nfrom the east took priority,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.85,0:06:37.16,MX Default,Zhao General A,0,0,0,,and relaying his message was postponed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.96,0:06:41.52,MX Default,Zhao General A,0,0,0,,Shun Shuishu has detected some \Nsuspicious activity among the Qin army
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.52,0:06:43.26,MX Default,Zhao General A,0,0,0,,and is remaining in Shenhua.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.56,0:06:46.05,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,"Suspicious activity"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.65,0:06:50.77,MX Default,Zhao General A,0,0,0,,According to his messenger... \Nthey may be deceiving us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.77,0:06:55.26,MX Default,Zhao General A,0,0,0,,It's possible the Qin army is changing \Nits route after Jin'an, he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:06:58.54,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Changing its route? Starting at Jin'an?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:02.32,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Bring me the western map again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:03.00,MX Default,Zhao General A,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:05.89,MX Default,Zhao General A,0,0,0,,Do we have enough pieces?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.89,0:07:08.11,MX Default,Kaine,0,0,0,,Plenty. Now be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:11.11,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Am I being deceived?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.11,0:07:18.41,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,JIN'AN
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:15.52,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Jin'an... the provisions depot...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:18.41,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,a supply line stretching to Heiyong...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:21.74,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Is it all a sham? Absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.74,0:07:24.92,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Think of the preparation \Nrequired to fake a supply line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.68,0:07:31.59,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,But let's suppose for a moment that\N most of their provisions are still in Jin'an...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:31.59,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,JIN'AN
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:36.91,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,That would mean the Qin army will collect \Nthe provisions and then change routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.91,0:07:41.10,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,But where would an allied army \Nof 200 thousand strong be going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:45.45,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,The Yellow River blocks their path south.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.45,0:07:49.45,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Heading east from there brings \Nthem to the impenetrable...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:51.65,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(470.857,28.857)}HANDAN
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:51.65,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(515.429,182)}YÈ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.06,0:07:51.09,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,...capital region.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:53.82,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(441.143,110)}HANDAN
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:56.03,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(444.571,241.429)}YÈ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.97,0:07:56.03,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Yè?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:07:59.08,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(457.143,121.429)}YÈ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:07:59.08,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Qin army!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.41,0:08:02.04,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Are you out of your minds?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:07.47,MX Default,Lookout,0,0,0,,Messenger birds. That's unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:10.09,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,TAIHANG MOUNTAINS
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.47,0:08:09.70,MX Default,Lookout,0,0,0,,Flying over the mountains to Handan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.04,0:08:12.67,MX Default,Lookout,0,0,0,,Wh-What the--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:17.64,MX Default,Lookout,0,0,0,,Wh-What on earth is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:20.68,On Top - More Top,Caption,0,0,0,,HANDAN, ROYAL CAPITAL OF ZHAO
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:30.44,On Top - More Top,Caption,0,0,0,,KING DAOXIANG OF ZHAO
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:30.44,MX Default,King Daoxiang,0,0,0,,Qin, attacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:33.65,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness. Li Mu has \Nbeen sending bird after bird
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.65,0:08:37.24,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,over the Taihang Mountains, \Nwith mounting urgency!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:41.31,MX Default,King Daoxiang,0,0,0,,After my bath, are they? \NWell, they won't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.31,0:08:43.22,MX Default,King Daoxiang,0,0,0,,Time to fight, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.22,0:08:47.50,MX Default,King Daoxiang,0,0,0,,Even if the rest of the world burns,\Nwe must defend this paradise to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.92,0:08:54.34,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,Y-Your Highness! This is no \Ntime to be joking around!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.78,0:08:56.14,MX Default,Guo Kai,0,0,0,,Hu Zhou.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:09:00.14,MX Default,Guo Kai,0,0,0,,His Highness is recovering \Nfrom the day's exhaustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:03.76,MX Default,Guo Kai,0,0,0,,Besides, the Qin army is beyond the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:06.72,MX Default,Guo Kai,0,0,0,,They won't even have \Nengaged the Zhao army yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:10.82,MX Default,Guo Kai,0,0,0,,By what means would they arrive in Handan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:13.03,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,They're not crossing the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.52,0:09:17.32,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,They made it look like they were attacking \Nthe west, then circled around south,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:21.58,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,following the Yellow River here to \Ninvade the royal capital region.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:24.08,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,There are some 200 thousand of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.58,0:09:25.79,MX Default,Guo Kai,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:28.75,MX Default,King Daoxiang,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.16,0:09:33.01,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,Sire! Li Mu proposes mobilizing \NHandan's army at once
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:38.14,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(521.143,46)}HANDAN
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:38.14,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(540.571,170.572)}YÈ
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:38.14,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(156.571,255.143)}LIEWEI
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:38.14,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,and sending it to Liewei \Nto stop Qin from invading.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.13,0:09:41.85,MX Default,King Daoxiang,0,0,0,,That won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:46.77,MX Default,King Daoxiang,0,0,0,,Handan's mighty army is \Nfor safeguarding its king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.77,0:09:52.08,MX Default,King Daoxiang,0,0,0,,The army will never leave the capital \Nas long as the king is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.08,0:09:52.77,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,Wha--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.04,0:09:54.69,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,Y-Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.47,0:10:00.41,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,You mustn't be unreasonable.\N We don't have a moment to--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.01,0:10:05.16,MX Default,Guo Kai,0,0,0,,Li Mu's the one being unreasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.74,0:10:07.73,MX Default,Guo Kai,0,0,0,,Turning a blind eye to his own failings
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.73,0:10:12.42,MX Default,Guo Kai,0,0,0,,and ordering His Highness around \Nfrom afar, of all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.70,0:10:15.62,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,O-Ordering? Perish the thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.43,0:10:21.30,MX Default,King Daoxiang,0,0,0,,Do stop, Guo Kai. Old-man spittle \Nand sweat will dirty the waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:22.68,MX Default,Guo Kai,0,0,0,,Sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.09,0:10:25.52,MX Default,King Daoxiang,0,0,0,,He doesn't need a single Handan soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.52,0:10:30.03,MX Default,King Daoxiang,0,0,0,,We can call up a large enough army \Nfrom Yè and its environs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:32.69,MX Default,King Daoxiang,0,0,0,,Would that be sufficient?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:40.41,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,Yes, ah... if Handan were not to \Nmobilize... Li Mu said to do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.66,0:10:41.41,MX Default,Guo Kai,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.77,0:10:45.66,MX Default,Guo Kai,0,0,0,,If you have another plan, \Nthen say so, you damn geezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:50.12,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,R-Royal orders received...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:54.80,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,I'll ask General Gongsun Long\N to take command.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:56.05,MX Default,King Daoxiang,0,0,0,,Just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:10:58.51,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,Sire?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:11:02.79,MX Default,King Daoxiang,0,0,0,,Li Mu should have been \Nbeheaded for his error.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.79,0:11:04.93,MX Default,King Daoxiang,0,0,0,,Where is he now, and what is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.50,0:11:08.06,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,Worry not, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:12.76,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,Li Mu is currently riding with the army\Nthrough the passage between mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:15.31,MX Default,Hu Zhou,0,0,0,,on his way to the royal capital region!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:20.90,MX Default,Fu Di,0,0,0,,Are we sure about this? No one's managing \Nto keep up with us in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.23,0:11:22.62,MX Default,Mǎ Nanci,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.11,0:11:28.56,MX Default,Mǎ Nanci,0,0,0,,Right now, it's all about Li Mu returning \Nto the capital region as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.87,0:11:32.04,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Shun Shuishu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.66,0:11:36.75,MX Default,Shun Shuishu,0,0,0,,My apologies for remaining \Nat the front for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:41.70,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,No, it's thanks to you that we could \Nget a bird to Handan so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:44.88,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,That may have made a big \Ndifference in the outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:48.43,MX Default,Fu Di,0,0,0,,So now we're all racing to Liewei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:53.70,MX Default,Shun Shuishu,0,0,0,,The Qin army won't reach Liewei that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:56.74,MX Default,Mǎ Nanci,0,0,0,,It all depends on how much the \Nmidsized cities along the way
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.74,0:11:58.65,MX Default,Mǎ Nanci,0,0,0,,can manage to slow them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:12:00.57,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:04.03,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,QIN
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.03,0:12:22.67,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,FEI
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.35,0:12:08.74,MX Default,Yuan,0,0,0,,Aren't we moving a little too fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.22,0:12:13.75,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Maybe, but Wang Jian and Huan Yi are \Neven further ahead with their cavalries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.24,0:12:18.95,MX Default,Chu Shui,0,0,0,,Doesn't this route veer too \Nmuch to the south, Diao?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.95,0:12:21.38,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,That's so we can steer clear of the big cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:22.67,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,With our numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.67,0:12:26.15,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,small-town armies will just shut \Nthemselves up behind walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:31.31,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,ZHAO
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.03,0:12:31.31,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,But a big-city army will \Ndefinitely try to slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:33.99,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Rather than get caught up in that,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.99,0:12:37.63,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,it's better to aim for Liewei while \Navoiding as much fighting as possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.63,0:12:40.15,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,even if it means we go off course a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.13,0:12:43.03,MX Default,Tian Shui,0,0,0,,Hey! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.39,0:12:44.88,MX Default,Tian Shui,0,0,0,,A massive lake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:46.28,MX Default,Fei Xin Member A,0,0,0,,Wow! Sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:48.80,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,That's the Yellow River, you dummies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:50.99,MX Default,Chu Shui,0,0,0,,And if the Yellow River's come into view,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.99,0:12:53.12,MX Default,Chu Shui,0,0,0,,we just need to follow it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:56.10,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,...and we'll reach Liewei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.67,0:12:57.88,MX Default,Qin General B,0,0,0,,Enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:13:01.80,MX Default,Qin General B,0,0,0,,Zhao army cavalry approaching \Nfrom the left-front!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.19,0:13:04.74,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Where? I can't see 'em from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:06.70,MX Default,Yuan,0,0,0,,Seems they're still far up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.36,0:13:11.13,MX Default,Scout,0,0,0,,Report! Three to five thousand of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.13,0:13:15.48,MX Default,Scout,0,0,0,,They're split into two, about to storm \Nour front and flank from the left!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:20.19,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,WANG
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:20.19,MX Default,Wang Jian Aide,0,0,0,,Wang Jian, sir, the enemy's cavalry \Nis faster than we expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.63,0:13:23.90,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,No changing course. \NKeep moving straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:26.82,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.90,0:13:28.57,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.57,0:13:30.83,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,HUAN
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.05,0:13:30.83,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Huan Yi's on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:39.29,MX Default,Zhao Soldier A,0,0,0,,Kill them! Kill the bastards \Nwho'd defile Zhao land!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.29,0:13:41.00,MX Default,Huan Yi Soldier A,0,0,0,,Shut up, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.68,0:13:51.64,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,ZHAO / HUAN
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:51.64,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,I-Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.96,0:13:52.85,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:55.10,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:59.58,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,The battle between Huan Yi's army \Nand the Zhao army has begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.11,0:14:03.09,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Th-This is war--for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.47,0:14:05.28,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:07.70,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,The main forces--Wang Jian's army--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:09.82,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,they're ignoring Huan Yi's \Narmy and marching on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:12.16,MX Default,Ping Lai,0,0,0,,They really are! That's awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.84,0:14:15.34,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,What's General Wang Jian thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.95,0:14:19.20,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,If we all surround Zhao, we can\Noverwhelm 'em on numbers alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.20,0:14:21.57,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,No, it's better this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.61,0:14:26.23,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,The enemy is looking to \Nslow down the allied army.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.23,0:14:29.30,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Tackling them all together would be \Nplaying right into their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:35.52,MX Default,Tian Yǒu,0,0,0,,But no matter how much Huan Yi's army \Nhas numbers and might on its side,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:37.85,MX Default,Tian Yǒu,0,0,0,,they'll still have their casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.64,0:14:44.02,MX Default,Tian Yǒu,0,0,0,,The mountainfolk army is just \Nmarching right along, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.87,0:14:48.30,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,This is one of the benefits of an allied army.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:50.49,MX Default,Tian Yǒu,0,0,0,,One of the benefits?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.85,0:14:54.54,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Each of these three armies is powerful enough
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.54,0:14:57.98,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,to win a Heiyong-level battle on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.42,0:14:59.50,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:04.50,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,this allied army can tackle three \Ndifferent situations at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.89,0:15:08.55,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Three situations at once...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.94,0:15:18.72,MX Default,Lord Changping,0,0,0,,The more complex things become\N as the Yè offensive progresses,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.72,0:15:22.15,MX Default,Lord Changping,0,0,0,,the more we'll see the benefits that \Nwe'd hoped for from the allied army.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.64,0:15:23.86,MX Default,Lord Changping,0,0,0,,And when that happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:28.93,MX Default,Lord Changping,0,0,0,,Qin will encounter situations where\Nyour abilities will be vitally necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:34.70,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Don't pay Huan Yi's army any mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:38.66,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,They just happen to be the ones \Nwith a role to play this time around!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:42.38,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,The Fei Xin Force will have \Nplenty of its own roles comin' up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:44.72,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Joinin' in the fightin' now or watchin' it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.72,0:15:47.05,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,would just be a waste of \Nthe blood they're sheddin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.51,0:15:52.41,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,The crucial thing now is stormin' \Nthe royal capital region
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.41,0:15:54.39,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,while Li Mu is still one step behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.39,0:15:56.22,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Let's go, gang!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.33,0:16:07.02,MX Default,Chu Shui,0,0,0,,Na Gui.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:10.28,MX Default,Chu Shui,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.61,0:16:14.45,MX Default,Na Gui,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.45,0:16:30.17,MX Default,Tian Yǒu,0,0,0,,A whole {\i1}other{\i0} army doing battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:32.51,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,YU / ZHAO
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:32.51,MX Default,Yuan,0,0,0,,That's the Yu Feng Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:33.72,MX Default,Zhao Soldier B,0,0,0,,Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.81,0:16:38.89,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Wang Ben...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:42.93,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,No rubberneckin'! Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.93,0:16:49.82,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Although the Zhao army blocked the \Npath of the allied army several times,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.82,0:16:52.93,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Wang Jian kept sending\N detached forces after them,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.93,0:16:55.66,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and the main army marched steadily onward.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.01,0:17:03.03,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,In short, Zhao was entirely unable \Nto slow the Qin army's advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:05.83,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,XIANYANG
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.69,0:17:05.83,MX Default,Qin Messenger A,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:10.30,MX Default,Qin Messenger A,0,0,0,,The allied army is making good progress \Nafter changing routes at Jin'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.77,0:17:15.18,MX Default,Qin Messenger A,0,0,0,,They're thought to be in the \Nvicinity of Langtu by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:19.39,MX Default,Lord Changwen,0,0,0,,Langtu, already?! Isn't that too fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:22.63,MX Default,Lord Changping,0,0,0,,One whole day faster than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.63,0:17:23.85,MX Default,Jie Yi,0,0,0,,I knew they could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:29.06,MX Default,Lord Changping,0,0,0,,Once they're past Langtu, they'll \Nreach Liewei in about two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.32,0:17:32.57,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(270.857,220.857)}LIEWEI
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.18,0:17:32.57,MX Default,Lord Changwen,0,0,0,,Liewei...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.21,0:17:36.82,MX Default,Zheng,0,0,0,,So this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:43.47,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,So we'll make Liewei \Ntomorrow or the day after?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.47,0:17:44.70,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.12,0:17:49.04,MX Default,Wo Lu,0,0,0,,The cork that's stopping up the \Nentrance to the Zhao capital region?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:54.96,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Right. Liewei is the equivalent of \NQin's national gate: the Hangu Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.51,0:17:58.09,MX Default,Yuan,0,0,0,,The Hangu Pass...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.95,0:18:08.27,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Then first we gotta smash Liewei \Nto bits, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:12.35,MX Default,Chu Shui,0,0,0,,Did General Wang Jian send \Nus any kind of a strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.35,0:18:13.94,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:18.07,MX Default,Wo Lu,0,0,0,,Hey, are you sure about this? \NWe're storming a national gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.07,0:18:20.91,MX Default,Wo Lu,0,0,0,,Shouldn't the entire army be in on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.25,0:18:25.02,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,I do think the Liewei offensive \Nwill be an all-out attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:29.24,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,If we struggle, the Zhao army will \Ntighten up defenses beyond Liewei,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.24,0:18:32.68,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,and Li Mu will return to the \Ncapital region from the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.68,0:18:36.77,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Once we get to Liewei,\Nwe have to conquer it in a flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:39.64,MX Default,Wo Lu,0,0,0,,That'll be a sight to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.64,0:18:42.60,MX Default,Wo Lu,0,0,0,,How does General Wang Jian \Ntake down a castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:45.49,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Whether it's tomorrow or the next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.49,0:18:48.81,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,we don't know what our role \Nis gonna be in all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.22,0:18:51.56,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Keep yourselves all fired up, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.85,0:18:53.26,MX Default,Qiang Lei,0,0,0,,Not the day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.22,0:18:55.19,MX Default,Qiang Lei,0,0,0,,It's tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.26,0:18:59.10,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,It's tomorrow, gang!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:05.20,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.53,0:19:09.66,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,which was the tenth day after \Nchanging course at Jin'an,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:14.22,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,the Wang Jian army vanguard \Nfinally reached Liewei.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.18,0:19:20.72,MX Default,Qin Messenger B,0,0,0,,Message from our scouts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.45,0:19:25.37,MX Default,Qin Messenger B,0,0,0,,There's no sign of a large \Nenemy army inside Liewei.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:29.15,MX Default,Qin Messenger C,0,0,0,,They believe we've arrived \Nbefore the Zhao royal army.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:30.44,MX Default,Qin General 1,0,0,0,,You don't say!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.87,0:19:34.33,MX Default,Qin General 2,0,0,0,,Guess those jerks had trouble rustling up
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.33,0:19:37.39,MX Default,Qin General 2,0,0,0,,a big enough army to stop 200 thousand of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:41.91,MX Default,Qin General 3,0,0,0,,I doubt they ever thought we had \Nour sights on their capital region.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.44,0:19:46.78,MX Default,Ya Guang,0,0,0,,Permission for the 1st Army \Nto begin deployment?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.78,0:19:49.25,MX Default,Ma Kuang,0,0,0,,The 2nd Army is ready at any time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.53,0:19:53.00,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Ya Guang, Ma Kuang. You two stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:58.25,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Get Yang Duanhe's army and the \NFei Xin Force out ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.66,0:20:01.17,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,We'll have {\i1}them{\i0} conquer Liewei.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.85,0:20:10.81,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,ZHAO
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.98,0:20:25.24,MX Default,Liewei General A,0,0,0,,Here come some idiots who think they can \Npop the royal-capital cork that is Liewei!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:29.52,MX Default,Liewei General A,0,0,0,,Reinforcements from the capital \Nregion will arrive in two days,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:31.70,MX Default,Liewei General A,0,0,0,,but don't rely on that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.03,0:20:35.46,MX Default,Liewei General A,0,0,0,,We'll slaughter the dogs who \Ndare approach our castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.46,0:20:41.80,MX Default,Liewei General A,0,0,0,,Got that, troops? Let the ground of \NLiewei be stained red with their blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:48.88,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Well, shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.88,0:20:52.26,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Our numbers seem to have \Nactually {\i1}boosted{\i0} their morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.26,0:20:54.98,MX Default,Hu Jian,0,0,0,,This'll be a tough one, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.98,0:21:03.90,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,LE
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.61,0:20:59.08,MX Default,Lu Xian,0,0,0,,Is General Wang Jian serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.08,0:21:03.90,MX Default,Lu Xian,0,0,0,,Conquering this castle with just the \NFei Xin Force and the mountainfolk?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.41,0:21:07.41,MX Default,Lu Xian,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.41,0:21:11.50,MX Default,Lu Xian,0,0,0,,I'm not sure the mountainfolk are capable \Nof the kind of high-level combat
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:12.98,MX Default,Lu Xian,0,0,0,,it takes to topple a castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.66,0:21:18.70,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Then I suppose it's time for the \NFei Xin Force to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:23.75,MX Default,Zhao Soldier Walla,0,0,0,,Long live Zhao! Long live Zhao!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.75,0:21:27.93,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,A castle grows far stronger with \Nthe morale of those defending it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.23,0:21:30.49,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,This is crunch time, all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:31.93,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Xin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.06,0:21:35.64,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Whatever General Wang Jian's intentions,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:38.81,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,if we're going to do this, let's do it \Nlike we're the only ones on the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.81,0:21:40.32,MX Default,Xin & Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:43.57,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,And within two days, at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.87,0:21:45.32,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,We'll do it in half a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.93,0:21:46.99,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.48,0:21:50.70,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,So, uh, do you have a good plan, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.99,0:21:52.95,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Storming a castle is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.69,0:21:57.42,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Scale the walls, open the gates from inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.42,0:22:00.46,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,let in the rest of your team, \Nand bring the inside to heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.59,0:22:03.68,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Is there any other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.68,0:22:08.24,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Well, uh, n-no, but that's \Neasier said than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.24,0:22:09.72,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Yang Duanhe...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.04,0:22:12.79,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,We'll tackle the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.79,0:22:16.94,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Fei Xin Force, prepare to storm \Nthe castle once the gates open.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.90,0:22:22.61,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is, \Nthe walls are the hard part!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.05,0:22:24.81,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Worry not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.81,0:22:28.24,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Mountainfolk have a mountainfolk \Nway of fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.24,0:22:30.49,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Now hang on, Yang Duanhe!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.49,0:22:32.70,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,"A mountainfolk way of fighting"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.98,0:22:37.21,MX Default,Ba Jio,0,0,0,,It's more like "the Duanhe way of fighting."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.09,0:22:44.14,MX Default,Ba Jio,0,0,0,,Over a hundred mountain tribes \Nare gathered here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.87,0:22:48.47,MX Default,Ba Jio,0,0,0,,Even large tribes like the Figo and the Mela.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.47,0:22:49.93,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,A hundred?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.47,0:22:54.62,MX Default,Ba Jio,0,0,0,,All thanks to a single queen: Yang Duanhe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.29,0:22:59.69,MX Default,Ba Jio,0,0,0,,Feared as the Death Queen of the \Nmountains, yet beloved as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.32,0:23:05.32,MX Default,Ba Jio,0,0,0,,That one person has managed to \Nunify the entire mountain realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.80,0:23:12.46,MX Default,Ba Jio,0,0,0,,Watch. Yang Duanhe always \Noverpowers the foe head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.00,0:24:55.01,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,STORMING LIEWEI
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.29,0:24:53.02,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Next on Kingdom: "Storming Liewei."

